# GitLab security scanner output, written to the repo root in CI and read by
# scripts/ci/security-gate.mjs. Deliberately a single glob: the analyzers emit
# gl-sast-report.json, gl-secret-detection-report.json,
# gl-dependency-scanning-report.json, gl-sbom-*.cdx.json *and* gl-report-post.json,
# and that last one does not match a `gl-*-report.json` pattern.
/gl-*.json
